# Runtime logs from the local uvicorn dev server (never part of the product)
.uvicorn.out.log
.uvicorn.err.log

# The API version floor (version_gate.FLOOR_FILE): a per-deployment operator
# value, not code. Absent = the compiled default (0, accept every client).
# Raising it is a data edit an operator makes on the server; it is never part
# of the product and must never be committed, exactly like .env.
api_version_floor
